<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 30px 0;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <h2 style="color: #2c3e50; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">Welcome to Bytes Exchange</h2>

                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                  Welcome to <strong>Bytes Exchange</strong> — we’re thrilled to have you join our growing community of traders, investors, and innovators in the digital asset space.
                </p>

                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                  Your account has been successfully created at 
                  <a href="https://bytesexchange.com/" target="_blank" style="color: #007bff; text-decoration: none;">https://bytesexchange.com/</a>.
                </p>

                <ul style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                  <li>Access your dashboard to track profit shares and payouts.</li>
                  <li>Join airdrops and incentive programs exclusively for members.</li>
                  <li>Receive updates from our top-tier research analysts on market trends.</li>
                  <li>Connect with the community via our 
                    <a href="https://t.me/bytesexchange" target="_blank" style="color: #007bff; text-decoration: none;">Telegram news feed</a>.
                  </li>
                </ul>

                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                  To make the most of your experience:
                  <br>1. Log in to your account to personalize your settings.
                  <br>2. Enable notifications for profit updates, bonus alerts, and announcements.
                  <br>3. Follow us on Telegram and stay informed with real-time crypto insights.
                </p>

                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                  We’re here to help you stay ahead of the market and grow with confidence.  
                  <br>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to our Client Success Team at 
                  <a href="mailto:support@bytesexchange.com" style="color: #007bff; text-decoration: none;">support@bytesexchange.com</a>.
                </p>

                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                  <strong>Welcome aboard,</strong><br>
                  The Bytes Exchange Team<br>
                  <a href="https://www.bytesexchange.com" target="_blank" style="color: #007bff; text-decoration: none;">www.bytesexchange.com</a>
                </p>

                <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 30px 0;">

                <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888; text-align: center;">
                  © 2025 Bytes Exchange™. All rights reserved.
                </p>
